@startuml Traceability_Conceptual_Data_Model

title Week 10 Conceptual Data Model - Event-centred Traceability

top to bottom direction
hide methods
hide stereotypes
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam nodesep 55
skinparam ranksep 65

class Organisation {
  identities, sites and devices
  consortium membership
}

class IdentityAndKey {
  delegated authority
  public key validity and revocation
}

class ProfileAndPolicyVersion {
  product rules
  visibility and retention rules
}

class TraceEvent {
  event type
  event time and record time
  business step and disposition
  commitment and signature
}

class TraceableObject {
  batch, pallet or product class
}

class EventObjectRole {
  SUBJECT, PARENT, CHILD
  INPUT or OUTPUT
  quantity and UOM
}

class ExternalArtifactReference {
  opaque locator
  content commitment
  availability and policy
}

class LedgerCommitment {
  network and transaction
  payload commitment and receipt
}

class CorrectionChain {
  original event
  error declaration
  corrective event
}

class HandoverView {
  shipping and receiving assertions
  pending, accepted, partial,
  rejected or disputed
}

class LineageView {
  CONTAINS and DERIVED_FROM
  upstream and downstream impact
}

class AudienceAndCurrentStateView {
  consumer, participant or auditor
  disposition, custodian and status
}

Organisation "1" o-down- "0..*" IdentityAndKey : controls
Organisation "1" <-- "0..*" TraceEvent : publishes
IdentityAndKey "1" <-- "0..*" TraceEvent : signs
ProfileAndPolicyVersion "1" <-- "0..*" TraceEvent : governs

TraceEvent "1" o-left- "1..*" EventObjectRole : involves
EventObjectRole "0..*" -left-> "1" TraceableObject : identifies
TraceEvent "0..*" -- "0..*" ExternalArtifactReference : references
TraceEvent "1" -- "0..1" LedgerCommitment : verified by
CorrectionChain --> TraceEvent : links immutable events

TraceEvent ..down.> HandoverView : projects
TraceEvent ..down.> LineageView : projects
TraceEvent ..down.> AudienceAndCurrentStateView : projects
TraceableObject "1" <-- "0..*" HandoverView : subject
TraceableObject "1" <-- "0..*" LineageView : connects

note right of TraceEvent
  Authoritative history is append-only.
  Correction appends new events.
end note

note bottom of LineageView
  Derived views can be deleted and rebuilt
  from committed TraceEvents.
end note

@enduml
